WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,350
You are too impulsive

2
00:00:01,990 --> 00:00:04,310
I know what I'm doing I'm keeping my hand

3
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:06,870
If it doesn't really kill her, she can come at me.

4
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:08,670
But you can't casually comment on her other people's dignity

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,490
But you should also have a degree in doing things

6
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,050
They talk about the power of family

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,170
Not what you can imagine

8
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:15,330
This person is so small

9
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:16,850
She can't let you go if you do this

10
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,440
I should call security to come over and solve it as soon as possible

11
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,600
It wouldn't be like this. Call the security guard.

12
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,000
She will also humiliate the security guard

13
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,320
The security guard may not dare to offend her, but it will still be the same trouble

14
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,440
So if you carry someone by yourself, I will bear the consequences of my beating.

15
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,380
Won't cause you any trouble

16
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:31,980
You said it's simple

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,900
Is this something you can afford?

18
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,900
Have you ever seen eggs soaked in rocks?

19
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,420
In the final analysis, this matter is because of me and you are my assistant.

20
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,460
It's to protect me

21
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,780
Then of course I can't let you bear the consequences.

22
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,020
Jiang Wenming is nothing

23
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,260
Mainly because they talk about home

24
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,100
But they don’t dare to go against our family

25
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:49,980
I will tell my dad about the situation

26
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,140
He arranged for you to come here

27
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:54,870
He won't stand idly by, thank you, don't take it seriously.

28
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,470
He won't let it go after suffering a loss

29
00:00:56,590 --> 00:00:58,750
I like to use the worst methods, but I don’t dare to

30
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:02,310
It's troublesome to be dumped in the ground. I'll pay attention and thank you.

31
00:01:02,470 --> 00:01:04,310
You did your duty as an assistant and passed this incident

32
00:01:04,430 --> 00:01:05,510
He should not dare to come to me again

33
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:12,460
It's one less thing to worry about. I have to work, why don't you go out? Have you been scolded?

34
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:13,900
I have to stand and wait for him to finish cursing

35
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,700
I don't care what his salary is

36
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,500
Even if he pesters Zhang Yuhan, I can’t ignore Chen Dong.

37
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:19,740
These guys are here to find you

38
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:23,100
He said there is something and I need your cooperation in the investigation. Hello.

39
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:24,420
May I ask what you want from me?

40
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,600
I don't know what's going on
